-    Sample $N=128$ points along each ray. Compute pixel color $\hat{C}(\mathbf{r})$:
-    $$\hat{C}(\mathbf{r}) = \sum_{i=1}^N T_i (1 - \exp(-\sigma_i \delta_i)) \mathbf{c}_i$$
